# Meridian Insurance — a fictional model, written to be *looked at*.
#
# It exists so the container has something worth serving: enough elements,
# relationships and layers that every page of `amcli web` has real content —
# the folder tree, the element and relationship tables, the graph, and views
# drawn by the same layout `view auto` runs.
#
# Everything here is invented. There is nothing in it to keep secret.
#
# Re-runnable: every line is `if_absent`, and the build script pins
# AMCLI_ID_SEED, so rebuilding the model produces the same bytes.

